== Overview ==
The Mob Boss Toilet is a [[Mythic]] [[Units|Unit]] added in the [[Season 2 Update]].

== Obtainment ==
The Mob Boss Toilet is obtained from the Season 2 Pass in tier 30. you can also get it from [[Trading]], buying from the [[Marketplace]], or getting gifted it from the [[Post Office]].

